sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant R as SwapRouter
    participant PM as PoolManager
    participant H as FixerHook
    participant REG as FixerRegistry

    U->>F: Select token pair and referrer
    F->>R: Build swap params with hookData
    R->>PM: Execute swap(key, params, hookData)
    PM->>H: Call afterSwap hook

    rect rgb(241, 245, 249)
        Note over H: Validation
        H->>H: Decode referrer from hookData
        H->>H: Validate referrer != tx.origin
    end

    H->>REG: recordReferral(referrer, volume)
    REG->>REG: Calculate reward
    REG->>REG: Update referrer stats
    REG->>REG: Check tier thresholds
    H-->>PM: Return (selector, 0)
    PM-->>R: Swap complete
    R-->>F: Transaction receipt
    F-->>U: Success - referral recorded
